preConditionHook:
// Off on one weekday: EL DayOfWeek(Date), 0 = Sunday .. 6 = Saturday, of the
// bar's wall-clock closing date (EL_Date_Probe.txt, 169/169 incl. evening bars),
// as DayOfWeekEntry reads it. Signals are taken at bar close and fill at the
// next open, so on DAILY bars blocking day D means no entry signalled on D's
// close (none filled on D+1's open), and a position open at D's close is
// flattened at D+1's open. On intraday bars the first bar closing on D
// flattens at the following open and the day stays blocked. Both sides same.
dow = day_of_week(day_of(ctx.Time(0)));
